<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/24/msa@/~cl_17> <https://schema.org/text> "Subseksyen 18(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"commission of an offence\" perkataan \"against this Act or any regulations made thereunder,\". Pindaan seksyen 19"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2004/24/msa@> .
